endobj
645 0 obj
<< /A 706 0 R /ActualText (Four-panel line chart comparing predicted claim size by premium across usage types for four models: bagging, boosting, ordinary least squares \(OLS\), and random forest. Each line represents a different usage type from the legend: FPP, G.Cartage, O.Goods, O.Service, Others, and Private. Bagging, boosting, and random forest panels show non-linear, fluctuating trends, while OLS presents straight, evenly spaced lines with upward slopes. Premium is on the x-axis and predicted claim size is on the y-axis.\r\n) /Alt (Four-panel line chart comparing predicted claim size by premium across usage types for four models: bagging, boosting, ordinary least squares \(OLS\), and random forest. Each line represents a different usage type from the legend: FPP, G.Cartage, O.Goods, O.Service, Others, and Private. Bagging, boosting, and random forest panels show non-linear, fluctuating trends, while OLS presents straight, evenly spaced lines with upward slopes. Premium is on the x-axis and predicted claim size is on the y-axis.\r\n) /K 0 /P 220 0 R /Pg 216 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
